This diagram is described in prose first.  The camera requires WebGPU (this sentence is prose and must
create NO capability requirement, see L18).  @@{ this is an escaped literal, not an island }
@{system vision "Vision System"}
@{type VideoFrame}
@{type EncodedVideo}
@{capability VIDEO_CAPTURE}
@{capability VIDEO_ENCODE}
@{effect STORAGE_WRITE}
@{component camera "Camera"}
NOTE: the camera is the only producer.
@{port camera.frame out: VideoFrame public}
@{requires camera VIDEO_CAPTURE}
@{data frame_flow camera.frame -> encoder.frame mode=move}
@{component encoder "Encoder"}
RATIONALE: encoding happens before storage.
@{port encoder.frame in: VideoFrame public}
@{port encoder.data out: EncodedVideo public}
@{requires encoder VIDEO_ENCODE}
@{uses encoder STORAGE_WRITE}
@{invariant inv_frame exactly_one_producer(encoder.frame)}
@{test t_frame static}
@{tests t_frame -> inv_frame}
@{evidence ev_frame static_proof}
@{witnesses ev_frame -> t_frame}
